# This folder follows a common structure for setting up MxP MESA grids 
# in this project. All models will follow the MESA physics set in the 
# template/MESA_input_src folder.
# Edit the inlists and run_star_extras.f90 there before generating the 
# grid. Do not forget to run ./mk in MESA_input_src if you modify the 
# run_star_extras.f90

# Run mk_grid to generate your grid. One folder for each mass will be 
# generated, within which will be the folders for individual periods. 
# This will also produce run_grid, a list of command lines that can be 
# submitted to slurm to run the whole grid; and dispatch_grid, a command 
# line to submit run_grid to slurm through disBatch. 
# (see https://github.com/flatironinstitute/disBatch)

# If you have disBatch installed, simply call ./dispatch_grid
# Otherwise check the sbatch command in dispatch_grid 

# If you need to modify the MESA settings, run ./clean to restore the 
# folder to its original configuration.

# Individual models can also be run from inside the mass-specific 
# folders. See ./template/README for further instructions.
